Third-party software
--------------------
VDRkit depends on open-source packages that keep their own copyright and licences. They are listed in the
package.json files and pnpm-lock.yaml, and each package ships its licence (and any NOTICE file of its own) in its
folder under node_modules, including in the Docker images. To list them with their licences, run:

    pnpm licenses list --prod

The server bundles the Noto Sans font (apps/server/fonts), Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors, under the SIL Open
Font License 1.1 (apps/server/fonts/OFL.txt). It is used for NDA PDFs and the watermark of downloaded PDFs.

The Docker Compose setup also runs separate images that are not part of VDRkit and keep their own licences:
PostgreSQL (with pgvector), Caddy, ClamAV and Gotenberg.
